<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">{{isRetry ? '重写本章' : '大纲确认'}}</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">{{project ? project.title : '加载中…'}} · 第 {{seq}} 章</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card">
    <view class="error-text">{{error}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card">
    <view class="empty">正在读取作品设定…</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{!loading}}" class="card">
    <view class="tip" wx:if="{{isRetry}}">
      这是重写。只有待确认章节能重写；定稿章节受记忆保护。
    </view>
    <view class="tip" wx:else>
      先确认大纲，再试写一个短片段。试写只用于看方向，不写记忆、不占章节；确认后才会写全章。
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="field-label">章节标题（可选）</view>
      <input
        class="input"
        value="{{title}}"
        data-field="title"
        bindinput="onInput"
        maxlength="120"
        placeholder="不填则自动编号"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="field flex">
        <view class="field-label">目标字数</view>
        <input
          class="input"
          type="number"
          value="{{targetWords}}"
          data-field="targetWords"
          bindinput="onInput"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="field flex">
        <view class="field-label">视角</view>
        <input
          class="input"
          value="{{pov}}"
          data-field="pov"
          bindinput="onInput"
          maxlength="40"
        />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="field-label">本章大纲<text class="field-required">*</text></view>
      <textarea
        class="textarea"
        value="{{outline}}"
        data-field="outline"
        bindinput="onInput"
        maxlength="20000"
        placeholder="这一章谁要做什么、被谁或什么规则压住、失败会失去什么、本章兑现什么、结尾留什么更大的问题。"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="field-label">文风约束（可选）</view>
      <textarea
        class="textarea"
        value="{{style}}"
        data-field="style"
        bindinput="onInput"
        maxlength="20000"
        placeholder="例如：克制、具体物件、少形容词；人物声口区分。"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="field-label">主要角色摘要（可选）</view>
      <textarea
        class="textarea"
        value="{{characterBrief}}"
        data-field="characterBrief"
        bindinput="onInput"
        maxlength="10000"
        placeholder="例如：许青，社区调解员，怕丢工作；老陶，修鞋匠，嘴硬。"
      />
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{sceneFields.length}}" class="field">
      <view class="field-label">场景卡（推荐填写本题材必填项）</view>
      <view class="scene-grid">
        <view
          wx:for="{{sceneFields}}"
          wx:key="name"
          class="field"
        >
          <view class="field-label">
            {{item.label}}<text wx:if="{{item.required}}" class="field-required">*</text>
          </view>
          <input
            class="input"
            value="{{item.value}}"
            data-index="{{index}}"
            bindinput="onSceneInput"
            placeholder="{{item.required ? '本题材必填' : '可选'}}"
          />
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="field-label">试写长度</view>
      <picker
        mode="selector"
        range="{{trialWordOptions}}"
        value="{{trialWordIndex}}"
        bindchange="onTrialWordChange"
      >
        <view class="picker">
          <text>{{trialWordOptions[trialWordIndex]}} 字左右</text>
          <text>›</text>
        </view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <button
      class="btn btn-primary btn-block"
      bindtap="startTrial"
      disabled="{{submitting}}"
    >
      {{submitting ? '提交中…' : '先试写，确认方向'}}
    </button>
    <button
      class="btn btn-ghost btn-block"
      bindtap="startGenerate"
      disabled="{{submitting}}"
    >
      跳过试写，直接写全章
    </button>
    <view class="hint">直接写全章会进入质量门；通过后立即写记忆，未通过则保存为待确认。</view>
  </view>
</view>
